---
---
<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="test-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container test-container">
    <div class="test-header">
      <h2>What <span>Our Customers</span> Say</h2>
      <p>Here you will see our customers' feedback. There are so many customers who are very happy to choose us as their flooring partner.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="test-grid">
      <div class="test-card">
        <div class="test-author">
          <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg" alt="Sarah M." />
          <h4>Sarah M.</h4>
        </div>
        <p>"Woodcove Flooring has truly amazed me! We love the quality of the hardwood and the amazing job of the installation team. Highly recommend them for anyone!"</p>
        <div class="dots">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="test-card">
        <div class="test-author">
          <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/46.jpg" alt="James L." />
          <h4>James L.</h4>
        </div>
        <p>"The entire process was smooth and hassle-free. The floors are stunning and incredibly durable. I am extremely pleased with Woodcove's service."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    position: relative;
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-image: url('/images/hero-bg.jpg'); /* Reusing hero bg due to quota */
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: #fff;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  .test-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgba(18, 52, 71, 0.85);
  }
  .test-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .test-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
  }
  .test-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .test-header h2 span {
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .test-header p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .test-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .test-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .test-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .test-author {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .test-author img {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }
  .test-author h4 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .test-card p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .dots .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .dots .dot:first-child {
    background: #fff;
  }
</style>
